# Frontend testing

- Unit/component tests: Vitest + Testing Library. Setup is `src/test/setup.js`.
- Colocate tests next to features (e.g. `src/features/auth/Login.test.jsx`, `src/seo/seo.test.js`). Prefer that over a flat `src/test/components/` tree.
- E2E: Playwright in `e2e/`, `baseURL` `http://localhost:5173`, `npm run test:e2e`.
- Do not remove existing tests. Extend them.
- Cover the behavior you changed, plus the obvious failure path (validation error, unauthenticated redirect).
- Do not hit production APIs from unit tests. Mock `fetch` / env.

```javascript
// ❌ BAD — deleting a failing test to ship
// ✅ GOOD — extend src/features/auth/Login.test.jsx with the new case
```
